655
01:03:52.662 --> 01:03:55.404
<font color="#D900D9">(CROWD CHEERING)</font>

656
01:04:02.305 --> 01:04:04.717
<font color="#D900D9">(CROWD CHANTING)</font>

657
01:04:10.413 --> 01:04:13.189
<font color="#D900D9">(چەکدارانی خەڵک)</font>

658
01:04:22.692 --> 01:04:23.693
شەڕڤانان!

659
01:04:39.676 --> 01:04:41.246
