01:11:11.234 --> 01:11:14.010
<font color="#D900D9">(CROWD CHEERING)</font>

718
01:11:42.498 --> 01:11:43.704
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANING)</font>

719
01:12:06.722 --> 01:12:08.133
