747
01:14:51.020 --> 01:14:53.694
- <font color="#D900D9">(CROWD CHEERING)</font> - <font color="#D900D9">(SHOWING FOREIGN LANGUE)</font>

748
01:15:02.865 --> 01:15:04.037
